@startuml packages
skinparam backgroundColor #F8FAFC
skinparam defaultFontName Helvetica
skinparam defaultFontSize 17
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
top to bottom direction
title Source packages — shared Swift interface and resident application
package "Koine application" {
  component "<color:white><b>Start here · macOS composition</b></color>\n<color:white>UI · HTTP · native loader · storage adapters</color>" as App #25364B
}
package "Machine · platform-independent Swift" {
  component "Schema composition\nAuthorization · GraphQL execution" as Machine
}
package "KoineProviderAPI · shared resilient Swift framework" {
  component "Provider protocols + value types\nLibrary evolution · module stability" as API
}
package "Desktop provider · separate Swift binary" {
  component "Desktop schema + resolvers\nmacOS observation and actions" as Desktop
}
package "ModalAnyware · separate client" {
  component "Machine client\nGraphQL tooling + credential storage" as Client
}
App ..> Machine : composes
App ..> API : supplies one framework image
Machine ..> API : invokes provider contracts
Desktop ..> API : dynamically links\nimplements Provider
Client ..> App : public GraphQL contract
note bottom of App
Start here: application composition.
Packages are source/dependency boundaries.
Loaded providers run in the Koine process.
end note
note bottom of Machine
No macOS, client or concrete-provider dependency.
GraphQL-library types remain private.
Published provider types use the shared Swift ABI.
end note
@enduml
